# Pairs with ReadRequiresActiveGrant. If a pending offer resolved to an allow
# the approval would be decorative.
MODULE: ReadAdmitsPendingGrant
TARGET: ReadRequiresActiveGrant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grant resolution admits a pending grant as well as an active one
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
        grantOk == status["A"] = "active" /\ Live(x) /\ x.st = "active" /\ n = "orders"
--- REPLACE
        grantOk == status["A"] = "active" /\ Live(x) /\ x.st \in {"pending", "active"} /\ n = "orders"
--- END